# The FM-1 Screen Reader: nothing is said until a reader listens; then the page, a knob as it settles, play and
# stop, record, a step switched on, a message, and the whole screen when asked
wait 300
tap EDIT
wait 300
listen
wait 100
said SOUND. T1 SYNTH VA
turn K4 1
wait 300
said VELO 65
tap PLAY
wait 100
said PLAYING
tap PLAY
wait 100
said STOPPED
tap SEQ
wait 400
said STEPS
tapkey 2
wait 100
said STEP 2 ON
tap REC
wait 100
said RECORD ARMED
tap REC
wait 100
said RECORD OFF
where
wait 100
said KEYS
